# Client transport follow-up

- Recovery after a server restart with the browser online waits on backoff: no browser
  signal says the server is back, so the first connection through depends on the
  randomized delay (Hocuspocus `maxDelay` 30 s, thread `persistentDelayMs` 30 s;
  observed 0.8–22 s). Peer success then pulls the other connections within ~0.5 s.
  Lowering those caps trades reconnect load for latency; revisit with production
  deploy-restart data.
